{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19920","headline":"秋怀 十五 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"詈言不见血，杀人何纷纷。\n声如穷家犬，吠窦何誾誾。\n詈痛幽鬼哭，詈侵黄金贫。\n言词岂用多，憔悴在一闻。\n古詈舌不死，至今书云云。\n今人咏古书，善恶宜自分。\n秦火不爇舌，秦火空爇文。\n所以詈更生，至今横絪緼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}